   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audiometry environment imrprovement project for early diagnosis of hearing loss in Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Developing Standard Mongolian Audiometry, 2. Establishing proper environment for checking hearing loss, 3. 2nd-3rd medical institutions&apos; doctors&apos; empowerment, 4. Improving awarness of youth in Ulaanbaatar, 5. Compliment hearking checking for the vulnerablae</narrative>
  </description>
